        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>I began writing about enthusiast hardware completely by accident. Picture a street cat wandering into a neighbor\u2019s house often enough that one day it never leaves\u2014that\u2019s pretty much my story. Except in this case, I used to sneak over to a sister publication\u2019s cubicles to look at high-end desktops.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-idg-base-theme-box-text inline-box\">\n<p><em>Welcome to The Full Nerd newsletter\u2014your weekly dose of hardware talk from the enthusiasts at PCWorld. Missed the surprising topics on</em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@thefullnerdpodcast\"><em> our YouTube show</em></a><em> or latest news from across the web? You\u2019re in the right place.\u00a0</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Want this newsletter to come directly to your inbox?</em><a href=\"https://www.pcworld.com/newsletters/signup\"><em> Sign up on our website</em></a><em>!</em></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>At <em>Maximu",
